        <button class="dark-mode-toggle">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="24px" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="24px" fill="#202124"><path d="M480-120q-150 0-255-105T120-480q0-150 105-255t255-105q14 0 27.5 1t26.5 3q-41 29-65.5 75.5T444-660q0 90 63 153t153 63q55 0 101-24.5t75-65.5q2 13 3 26.5t1 27.5q0 150-105 255T480-120Zm0-80q88 0 158-48.5T740-375q-20 5-40 8t-40 3q-123 0-209.5-86.5T364-660q0-20 3-40t8-40q-78 32-126.5 102T200-480q0 116 82 198t198 82Zm-10-270Z"/></svg>
        </button>
    </div>
    
</div>  <div class="inner-block-content rich-content">
    <h2 data-block-key="oq12n" id="advancing-embodied-intelligence-with-argon"><b>Advancing embodied intelligence with Argon</b></h2><p data-block-key="9ufuc">Argon bridges coding, visual perception, physics simulation, and embodied robot control. By reasoning natively over multi-view video, 3D geometry, contact mechanics, and proprioceptive telemetry, Argon understands not just what objects are in a scene, but how they physically interact with agents to accomplish whole-body dexterous tasks. Gemini 4 Argon marks an important milestone accelerating the path toward physical AGI. By building this core intelligence, our goal is to enable robotics that can work alongside humans to solve complex challenges.</p><h2 data-block-key="8tvsz" id="getting-started"><b>Getting started</b></h2><p data-block-key="aoplg">You can start building with <b>Gemini 4 Argon</b> today across Google’s developer platforms:</p><p data-block-key="5cckl"></p><ul><li data-block-key="9vgdh"><a href="https://aistudio.google.com/">Google AI Studio</a><b>:</b> Available to <a href="https://one.google.com/about/google-ai-plans/">Google AI Ultra</a> subscribers.</li><li data-block-key="7nes0"><b>Gemini API:</b> Available with the paid tier of the Gemini API in AI Studio. Use <code>gemini-4-argon</code> in the <a href="https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs">Interactions API</a> with day-one support across the <code>google-genai</code> SDKs.</li><li data-block-key="954c"><b>Google Antigravity:</b> Available for Google AI Ultra subscribers. To start building, select <b>Gemini 4 Argon</b> (<code>gemini-4-argon</code>) as your active model in <a href="https://antigravity.google/">Google Antigravity</a> for complex planning, <code>/goal</code> runs, and multi-agent orchestration.</li></ul>
</div> 
      </div>
    </section>
    

